  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Make an Avatar with 256 non-local contact receivers or senders add a local contact receiver build will fail \"Error saying too many contacts 257\" despite it local receivers not being added to \"performance rank\" in SDK and Client. I don't know if it's me or a hard limit or something overlooked. My perspective should be like non-synced local parameters where they shouldn't count to limits since its local only. If it's intentional then maybe this could be a good feature request.",
